## 📜 Available Scripts

* `./build.sh install`: Installs dependencies via npm.
* `./build.sh dev`: Starts the local Vite development server with HMR.
* `./build.sh build`: Type-checks and bundles the app for production into the `dist/` folder.
* `./build.sh preview`: Boots up a local static web server to preview the `dist/` folder.
* `./build.sh clean`: Removes `node_modules` and build artifacts.
